Issues
------
* tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni (+2/-0/=F0=9F=92=AC48)
  2 issues created:
  - Editorial: Describe ECH chronologically rather than all client behavior=
 then all server behavior (by cbartle891)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/issues/412=20
  - Early data and ClientHelloOuter interaction (by davidben)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/issues/408=20

  7 issues received 48 new comments:
  - #412 Editorial: Describe ECH chronologically rather than all client beh=
avior then all server behavior (1 by dmcardle)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/issues/412=20
  - #408 Early data and ClientHelloOuter interaction (8 by cbartle891, chri=
s-wood, davidben)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/issues/408=20
  - #405 public_name edge cases and client checks (23 by bemasc, cbartle891=
, chris-wood, davidben, dmcardle, richsalz, sftcd)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/issues/405=20
  - #403 public_name and maximum_name_length could be smaller (4 by cbartle=
891, davidben, dmcardle)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/issues/403=20
  - #402 Not all of CHOuter is authenticated (4 by cbartle891, chris-wood, =
davidben)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/issues/402=20
  - #399 The serverhello.random trick is ugly and might interact with ticke=
t handling... (3 by cjpatton, davidben, martinthomson)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/issues/399=20
  - #397 Including the client's ephemeral public key in the AAD precludes u=
se of a single-shot HPKE API (5 by chris-wood, davidben, sftcd)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/issues/397=20



Pull requests
-------------
* tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni (+6/-0/=F0=9F=92=AC22)
  6 pull requests submitted:
  - Mirror early_data in ClientHelloOuter when applicable. (by chris-wood)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/415=20
  - Allow clients send a dummy PSK in ClientHelloOuter (by cjpatton)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/414=20
  - Add SHOULD for clients to validate public_name as a DNS hostname. (by d=
mcardle)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/413=20
  - Validate the contents of ClientHelloInner. (by chris-wood)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/411=20
  - Authenticate ClientECH extension position in ClientHelloOuterAAD. (by c=
hris-wood)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/410=20
  - Compress ECHConfigContents. (by chris-wood)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/409=20

  2 pull requests received 22 new comments:
  - #413 Add MUST for clients to validate ECHConfig.contents.public_name. (=
21 by bemasc, cbartle891, chris-wood, davidben, dmcardle, richsalz, sftcd)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/413=20
  - #410 Authenticate ClientECH extension position in ClientHelloOuterAAD. =
(1 by martinthomson)
    https://github.com/tlswg/draft-ietf-tls-esni/pull/410=20

* tlswg/dtls-conn-id (+0/-0/=F0=9F=92=AC1)
  1 pull requests received 1 new comments:
  - #96 zero-length CID clarification (1 by boaks)
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls-conn-id/pull/96=20

* tlswg/tls-subcerts (+1/-0/=F0=9F=92=AC0)
  1 pull requests submitted:
  - Correct text describing valid_time (by lukevalenta)
    https://github.com/tlswg/tls-subcerts/pull/83=20


